litic-note4", "translation": "Go after them from these things"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note5", "translation": "where aptius est που [somewhere], which is in the apograph"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note6", "translation": "Surely you have not advanced beyond these things and"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note7", "translation": "Or is there something holy, which"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note8", "translation": "What will you do, when you learn the rest?"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note9", "translation": "But you remember"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note10", "translation": "For surely this at least is not to be endured"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note11", "translation": "And no one has ever seen Zeus"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note12", "translation": "where Elmsley rightly του [somewhere]"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note13", "translation": "But of the mind of some god"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note14", "translation": "But I, after a long time, was praying for these things"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note15", "translation": "But of the gods"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note16", "translation": "If ever before, with bright eyes receive us now"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note17", "translation": "Great"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note18", "translation": "Orestes, then"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-note19", "translation": "If anything is not such"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-quote1", "translation": "is somewhere"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-quote2", "translation": "cowering"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-quote3", "translation": "of places"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-quote4", "translation": "further"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-quote5", "translation": "you cover"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-quote6", "translation": "evils?"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-quote7", "translation": "somewhere"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-quote8", "translation": "you dragged aside the word"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-quote9", "translation": "being defeated somewhere"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-quote10", "translation": "he fastened"}, {"id": "pou-enclitic-quote11", "translation": "to accomplish for the god